{"duration_api_ms":10889,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2828b6d4-da16-46f8-984a-4434716819c7","total_cost_usd":0.0216169,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":784,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":409},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":709,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":784,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":709},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1274,"outputTokens":259,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0002569,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":237,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":784,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":709,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.02136,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":409,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":709,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Yes. The benefit is real but indirect and bounded.**\n\n**Mechanism:** Under IRC §852(b)(6), a RIC recognizes no gain when it distributes appreciated securities in kind to meet redemptions. The ETF class can deliver its lowest-basis lots to authorized participants, removing embedded gains from the **shared portfolio**. Fewer realized gains mean smaller capital-gain distributions for **all** classes, including the mutual fund class.\n\n**Limits:**\n- The benefit depends on meaningful ETF-class redemption or creation flows. A small ETF class purges little.\n- Mutual fund class redemptions are usually paid in cash. That can force sales whose gains are distributed pro rata to every class, including ETF holders.\n- Basket selection is constrained by Rule 6c-11 custom-basket policies and the order's board oversight and anti-cross-subsidization conditions.\n- It is deferral, not elimination. Shareholders still owe tax when they sell their own shares.\n- Relief is fund-specific, granted by individual SEC exemptive order. Funds without an order cannot use this structure.","ttft_ms":6042,"type":"result","duration_ms":9658,"uuid":"acafc592-7592-4d22-8169-3f11e7650864","ttft_stream_ms":981,"time_to_request_ms":69,"first_content_frame_ms":981,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
